_⚠️ Potential issue_ | _🟡 Minor_

**Theme deletion switches selection before attempting removal — error leaves stale state.**

On Line 762, `colorThemeId` is set to `"system"` before `removeCustomTheme` is called on Line 764. If removal throws, the user sees an error but the theme selection has already changed. Consider moving the theme switch after successful deletion:

<details>
<summary>♻️ Proposed fix</summary>

```diff
 private func deleteTheme() {
     guard let theme = editingTheme else { return }

     do {
-        // If this theme is selected, switch to System first
-        if preferencesManager.settings.colorThemeId == theme.id {
-            preferencesManager.settings.colorThemeId = "system"
-        }
         try themeRegistry.removeCustomTheme(withId: theme.id)
+        // Switch to System after successful deletion
+        if preferencesManager.settings.colorThemeId == theme.id {
+            preferencesManager.settings.colorThemeId = "system"
+        }
         dismiss()
     } catch {
         errorMessage = "Failed to delete theme: \(error.localizedDescription)"
     }
 }
```
</details>

<!-- suggestion_start -->

<details>
<summary>📝 Committable suggestion</summary>

> ‼️ **IMPORTANT**
> Carefully review the code before committing. Ensure that it accurately replaces the highlighted code, contains no missing lines, and has no issues with indentation. Thoroughly test & benchmark the code to ensure it meets the requirements.

```suggestion
    private func deleteTheme() {
        guard let theme = editingTheme else { return }

        do {
            try themeRegistry.removeCustomTheme(withId: theme.id)
            // Switch to System after successful deletion
            if preferencesManager.settings.colorThemeId == theme.id {
                preferencesManager.settings.colorThemeId = "system"
            }
            dismiss()
        } catch {
            errorMessage = "Failed to delete theme: \(error.localizedDescription)"
        }
    }
```

</details>

<!-- suggestion_end -->

<details>
<summary>🤖 Prompt for AI Agents</summary>

```
In `@BatMon/Views/Settings/SettingsView.swift` around lines 756 - 769, In
deleteTheme(), avoid changing preferencesManager.settings.colorThemeId to
"system" before deletion; instead call themeRegistry.removeCustomTheme(withId:
theme.id) first and only update preferencesManager.settings.colorThemeId (to
"system") after the removeCustomTheme call succeeds (before calling dismiss()),
so any thrown error leaves the original selection intact; keep the existing
catch branch that sets errorMessage and ensure you still call dismiss() only on
success.
```

</details>

